-}
-
-// Draw rounded rects: ctx.roundRect(x+1, y+1, w-2, h-2, 3)
-// Small matrices (≤7 cols): render text inside cells
-// Large (24h heatmap): skip text
-// Rebuild on window.resize (absolute pixel dims)
-```
