-```
-
-### 稳健性检验 (`robustness.py`)
-
-```python
-def shuffle_test(factor: Series, forward_ret: Series, n_iter=1000) -> dict:
-    """随机打乱因子 1000 次，得到 IC 零假设分布 + p-value"""
